      "id": "sol.amc-8-1991-p4.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Since \\[ \\begin{aligned} &991+993+995 \\\\ &\\quad {}+997+999 \\\\ &= (1000-9)+(1000-7) \\\\ &\\quad {}+(1000-5) \\\\ &\\quad {}+(1000-3)+(1000-1) \\\\ &= 5000 - (9+7+5+3+1) \\\\ &= 5000 - 25, \\end{aligned} \\] we get \\(N = 25.\\)\n\nThus, the correct answer is E .",
      "hints": [
        "Each of the five numbers is just a little less than \\(1000\\)",
        "Write each as \\(1000 - k;\\) the sum becomes \\(5000 - (9+7+5+3+1)\\)"
      ],
